- exactly one finalize_attempt, 'unlanded', with reason conflict, conflictPaths including e2e/shared.txt, null landedRevision, and a rescueRef under refs/moe/rescue/task-c/ resolving to moe/task/task-c's tip;
- a failed completion record_commit whose `code` (the moe-agent.sh:5864 field) is MOE_COMMIT_FAILED_CONFLICT.
